msgid "## Getting Started"
msgstr "## 快速开始"

msgid ""
"vLLM-Ascend now supports prefill-decode (PD) disaggregation with EP (Expert "
"Parallel) options. This guide takes one-by-one steps to verify these "
"features with constrained resources."
msgstr "vLLM-Ascend 现已支持带有 EP（专家并行）选项的预填充-解码（PD）分离。本指南将逐步指导您在有限资源下验证这些功能。"

