msgid "# Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (DeepSeek)"
msgstr "# 预填充-解码分离（DeepSeek）"

msgid ""
"Take the DeepSeek-r1-w8a8 model as an example, use 4 Atlas 800T A3 servers "
"to deploy the \"2P1D\" architecture. Assume the IP of the prefiller server "
"is 192.0.0.1 (prefill 1) and 192.0.0.2 (prefill 2), and the decoder servers "
"are 192.0.0.3 (decoder 1) and 192.0.0.4 (decoder 2). On each server, use 8 "
"NPUs and 16 chips to deploy one service instance."
msgstr ""
"以DeepSeek-r1-w8a8模型为例，使用4台Atlas 800T "
"A3服务器部署\"2P1D\"架构。假设预填充服务器IP为192.0.0.1（prefill 1）和192.0.0.2（prefill "
"2），解码服务器为192.0.0.3（decoder 1）和192.0.0.4（decoder "
"2）。每台服务器使用8个NPU和16个芯片部署一个服务实例。"

msgid ""
"Mooncake is the serving platform for Kimi, a leading LLM service provided by Moonshot AI. Installation and Compilation Guide: <https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake?tab=readme-ov-file#build-and-use-binaries>\n"
"First, we need to obtain the Mooncake project. Refer to the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Mooncake是Moonshot AI提供的领先LLM服务Kimi的 serving 平台。安装和编译指南：<https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake?tab=readme-ov-file#build-and-use-binaries>\n"
"首先，我们需要获取Mooncake项目。参考以下命令："

msgid ""
"`launch_online_dp.py` starts `dp-size-local` vLLM instances and passes seven"
" positional arguments to `run_dp_template.sh`. The examples below correspond"
" to [Start the service](#start-the-service)."
msgstr ""
"`launch_online_dp.py`启动`dp-size-"
"local`个vLLM实例，并向`run_dp_template.sh`传递七个位置参数。以下示例对应[启动服务](#start-the-"
"service)。"

msgid ""
"| Launcher option | Template value | Meaning | Example value | Constraints |"
msgstr "| 启动器选项 | 模板值 | 含义 | 示例值 | 约束条件 |"

msgid ""
"| `--dp-size` | `$3` / `--data-parallel-size` | Total DP ranks in the group."
" | P: `2`; D: `32` | Positive integer; identical within the same group. "
"Total ranks must cover `[0, dp-size)` without overlap. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--dp-size` | `$3` / `--data-parallel-size` | 组内DP总秩数。 | P: `2`; D: `32` |"
" 正整数；同一组内必须一致。总秩数必须覆盖`[0, dp-size)`且不重叠。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--tp-size` | `$7` / `--tensor-parallel-size` | NPUs used by each "
"instance. | P: `8`; D: `1` | Positive integer; `dp-size-local * tp-size` "
"must not exceed available NPUs on the node.|"
msgstr ""
"| `--tp-size` | `$7` / `--tensor-parallel-size` | 每个实例使用的NPU数量。 | P: `8`; D:"
" `1` | 正整数；`dp-size-local * tp-size`不得超过节点上可用的NPU数量。|"

msgid ""
"| `--dp-size-local` | Number of template invocations | DP instances on this "
"node. | P: `2`; D: `16` | If set to `-1`, it defaults to `dp-size`. "
"Otherwise, `1 <= dp-size-local <= dp-size`.|"
msgstr ""
"| `--dp-size-local` | 模板调用次数 | 此节点上的DP实例数。 | P: `2`; D: `16` | "
"如果设置为`-1`，则默认为`dp-size`。否则，`1 <= dp-size-local <= dp-size`。|"

msgid ""
"| `--dp-rank-start` | `$4` / `--data-parallel-rank` = `dp-rank-start + i` | "
"First DP rank on this node. | P: `0`; D: `0` or `16` | Non-negative integer;"
" the assigned rank range must be within `dp-size` and not overlap. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--dp-rank-start` | `$4` / `--data-parallel-rank` = `dp-rank-start + i` | "
"此节点上的第一个DP秩。 | P: `0`; D: `0`或`16` | 非负整数；分配的秩范围必须在`dp-size`内且不重叠。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--dp-address` | `$5` / `--data-parallel-address` | DP master address. | "
"P: `192.0.0.1` or `192.0.0.2`; D: `192.0.0.3` | The IP address must be "
"reachable and identical within the same DP group. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--dp-address` | `$5` / `--data-parallel-address` | DP主节点地址。 | P: "
"`192.0.0.1`或`192.0.0.2`; D: `192.0.0.3` | IP地址必须可访问，且同一DP组内必须一致。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--dp-rpc-port` | `$6` / `--data-parallel-rpc-port` | DP master RPC port. "
"| `12321` | Free, reachable port; identical within a DP group. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--dp-rpc-port` | `$6` / `--data-parallel-rpc-port` | DP主节点RPC端口。 | "
"`12321` | 空闲且可访问的端口；同一DP组内必须一致。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--vllm-start-port` | `$2` / `--port` = `vllm-start-port + i` | First "
"local API port. | `7100`, then `7101`, ... | Consecutive free ports; must "
"match the proxy configuration. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--vllm-start-port` | `$2` / `--port` = `vllm-start-port + i` | "
"第一个本地API端口。 | `7100`，然后是`7101`，... | 连续的空闲端口；必须与代理配置匹配。 |"

msgid ""
"| Computed by the launcher | `$1` / `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` | NPU IDs "
"assigned to each instance. | P: `0,...,7`, `8,...,15`; D: `0` through `15` |"
" IDs must exist and not overlap; non-contiguous IDs require adapting the "
"launcher. |"
msgstr ""
"| 由启动器计算 | `$1` / `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` | 分配给每个实例的NPU ID。 | P: "
"`0,...,7`, `8,...,15`; D: `0`到`15` | ID必须存在且不重叠；非连续ID需要调整启动器。 |"

msgid ""
"- The launcher validates only argument types and required options. Check the remaining constraints before deployment.\n"
"    - If speculative decoding is enabled, `num_speculative_tokens` should be subject to one of the following conditions:\n"
"        1. Hybrid Mamba models (e.g., Qwen-Next and Qwen3.5 series): `num_speculative_tokens` should be equal on P nodes and D nodes.\n"
"        2. Other models: `num_speculative_tokens` on P nodes should be 1, and `num_speculative_tokens` on D nodes should be greater or equal to 1."
msgstr ""
"- 启动器仅验证参数类型和必需选项。部署前请检查其余约束条件。\n"
"    - 如果启用了投机解码，`num_speculative_tokens`应满足以下条件之一：\n"
"        1. 混合Mamba模型（例如Qwen-Next和Qwen3.5系列）：P节点和D节点上的`num_speculative_tokens`应相等。\n"
"        2. 其他模型：P节点上的`num_speculative_tokens`应为1，D节点上的`num_speculative_tokens`应大于或等于1。"

msgid "#### Non-layerwise"
msgstr "#### 非分层模式"

msgid "Both proxies share the following backend options."
msgstr "两个代理共享以下后端选项。"

msgid ""
"| Parameter | Applies to | Default | Example value | Meaning and constraints"
" |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 适用范围 | 默认值 | 示例值 | 含义和约束条件 |"

msgid ""
"| `--port` | Both | `8000` | `1999` | Proxy listen port. Must be free, "
"reachable, and between `1` and `65535`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--port` | 两者 | `8000` | `1999` | 代理监听端口。必须空闲、可访问，且在`1`到`65535`之间。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--host` | Both | `localhost` | `192.0.0.1` | Proxy listen address. "
"Layerwise mode requires a non-wildcard address reachable by D nodes. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--host` | 两者 | `localhost` | `192.0.0.1` | 代理监听地址。分层模式要求D节点可访问的非通配符地址。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--prefiller-hosts` | Both | `localhost` | `192.0.0.1 192.0.0.1 192.0.0.2 "
"192.0.0.2` | P-instance hosts. Count must equal the number of `--prefiller-"
"ports`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--prefiller-hosts` | 两者 | `localhost` | `192.0.0.1 192.0.0.1 192.0.0.2 "
"192.0.0.2` | P实例主机。数量必须等于`--prefiller-ports`的数量。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--prefiller-ports` | Both | `8001` | `7100 7101 7100 7101` | P-instance "
"ports. Each host-port pair must be unique and reachable. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--prefiller-ports` | 两者 | `8001` | `7100 7101 7100 7101` | P实例端口。每个主机-"
"端口对必须唯一且可访问。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--decoder-hosts` | Both | `localhost` | Sixteen `192.0.0.3`, then sixteen"
" `192.0.0.4` | D-instance hosts. Count must equal the number of `--decoder-"
"ports`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--decoder-hosts` | 两者 | `localhost` | 十六个`192.0.0.3`，然后是十六个`192.0.0.4` | "
"D实例主机。数量必须等于`--decoder-ports`的数量。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--decoder-ports` | Both | `8002` | `7100`-`7115` for each D host | "
"D-instance ports. Each host-port pair must be unique and reachable. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--decoder-ports` | 两者 | `8002` | 每个D主机的`7100`-`7115` | D实例端口。每个主机-"
"端口对必须唯一且可访问。 |"

msgid ""
"The proxy scripts validate that each host list has the same length as its "
"corresponding port list."
msgstr "代理脚本会验证每个主机列表与其对应的端口列表长度是否相同。"

msgid ""
"- You can place your datasets in the dir: `benchmark/ais_bench/datasets`\n"
"- You can change the configuration in the dir :`benchmark/ais_bench/benchmark/configs/models/vllm_api` Take the `vllm_api_stream_chat.py` for example"
msgstr ""
"- 您可以将数据集放在目录：`benchmark/ais_bench/datasets`中\n"
"- 您可以在目录：`benchmark/ais_bench/benchmark/configs/models/vllm_api`中更改配置。以`vllm_api_stream_chat.py`为例"

msgid ""
